From ef467408dac1c9a83e9309a2494e27e1846ace77 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:17:08 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] carriersettings: add carriers missing from the pixel list

samsung's ims profiles cover 160 plain mcc/mnc codes that have no
entry in carrier_list.pb, so those sims only ever get the default
config and never enable volte, vowifi or vt.

add a config per samsung operator with its ims switches and call
timers, and map mcc/mnc codes of operators the pixel list already
knows under another code to the existing config.
